  "description": "Add a soft, tactile dimension to your designs with Olivia, a playful bubble font that reimagines typography through a handcrafted lens. This unique display typeface features rounded, inflated letterforms constructed from a series of “beaded” segments, giving it a charming 3D-effect reminiscent of clay modeling or boutique jewelry. With its smooth curves and rhythmic repetition, Olivia is the premier choice for modern nursery branding, artisanal beadwork shops, playful stationery, and high-impact “craft-core” social media graphics.",
